    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "sabu Yawe y'a fɔ",
      "rationale": "Seere-daɲɛ: Yawe y'a fɔ de — kuma in bɛ Esawu ka kɛtaw jira."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Yakubu so na kɛ tasuma ye, Yusefu so na kɛ tasumayeelen ye, Esawu so na kɛ sɔgɔ ye; u bɛna u jɛgɛ, u bɛna u dun; mɔgɔ si tɛna to Esawu so la, sabu Yawe y'a fɔ.",
